CONTEXT
    Version: 2.102.0

    darwin/amd64 https://github.com/cli/cli/releases/download/v2.102.0/gh_2.102.0_macOS_amd64.zip
    darwin/arm64 https://github.com/cli/cli/releases/download/v2.102.0/gh_2.102.0_macOS_arm64.zip
    linux/amd64 https://github.com/cli/cli/releases/download/v2.102.0/gh_2.102.0_linux_amd64.tar.gz
    linux/arm64 https://github.com/cli/cli/releases/download/v2.102.0/gh_2.102.0_linux_arm64.tar.gz
    windows/amd64 https://github.com/cli/cli/releases/download/v2.102.0/gh_2.102.0_windows_amd64.zip
AS github_release

DO Resolve the GitHub CLI version from @options.gh_version when non-NULL,
    otherwise the Version entry in @github_release. Select its exact URL for
    @platform.os and @platform.arch. For a version override, replace only the
    default version in that URL. Return an object with version and url. AS github_package

PRINT "Step 1 of 3: Set up GitHub CLI (gh)."

DO Probe only @host.gh. Match the parsed version exactly to @github_package.version
    and check auth status for github.com. Treat missing, broken, or mismatched
    installations as not ready, and missing authentication as FALSE. Return an
    object with path, version, and Boolean ready and authenticated. AS github

IF @github.ready is FALSE
    DO Download and extract @github_package.url; install at @host.gh using @install_rules.
        Require @github_package.version. Return an object with path, verified version,
        ready TRUE, and Boolean authenticated from auth status for github.com. AS github

IF @github.authenticated is FALSE
    PRINT "Complete GitHub sign-in in the browser opened by the CLI. Its login URL or device code will be available in the terminal. Keep that terminal open until sign-in finishes."
    DO Run @host.gh auth login --hostname github.com --git-protocol https --web
        --skip-ssh-key in one user-visible interactive terminal session. Keep
        that session alive and wait for the process to exit successfully;
        never detach or background it. Then require @host.gh auth status
        --hostname github.com to succeed. Keep CLI-managed credentials without
        requesting or exposing tokens. If a persistent interactive session is
        unavailable, fail this instruction. Return @github with authenticated TRUE. AS github

PRINT Report the verified GitHub CLI version, path, and authentication state from @github.
